  "trial_reminders": {
    "_comment": "Oracle for the trial-ending reminder (backend.md section 10). The hand-off event follows the contract of messaging.push-reengagement (subject_key, state, fire_at, expires_at, params). `stored` is the reminder state kept on the trial term before the evaluation. An armed event uses reminder_seq (plus one when a resolved event was emitted first); a resolved event uses the stored reminder_seq. A free trial of a purchased, production term arms; every other term does not. `renewal_price` is the renewal price the chain holds in every case except `price-unknown-omits-price-params`, where the chain has none.",
    "config": {"TRIAL_REMINDER_LEAD_SECONDS": 172800, "TRIAL_REMINDER_MIN_NOTICE_SECONDS": 21600},
    "renewal_price": {"price_milliunits": 9990, "currency_code": "USD"},
